  "body": "Whether you're buying your first home or looking for a simple investment, this property offers an easy and practical solution.\r\nThe design focuses on low maintenance and efficient use of space, making it ideal for busy lifestyles or buyers who want something straightforward.\r\nThe open-plan living area is comfortable and functional, while the overall layout keeps things simple and easy to manage.\r\nLocated in the ever-growing Silverdale area, this home is well-positioned for both lifestyle and long-term value.\r\n* Floor Area: approx. 160 sqm\r\n* Land Area: approx. 136 sqm\r\n* 4 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms\r\nA no-fuss property that makes ownership simple.",
